WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.508
Your capstone: a profile of an island of your own choosing.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:08.976
Choose an island not covered in this course, ideally a lesser-known one.

00:00:08.976 --> 00:00:10.810
In three to four thousand words,

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:15.854
explain its physical geography with a map or terrain figure, its ecology through theory,

00:00:15.854 --> 00:00:18.375
its history, and its culture and governance.

00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:22.559
Review at least four peer-reviewed papers using the five-question method.

00:00:22.559 --> 00:00:26.456
And finish with a reflection: whose terms does your own profile use?

00:00:27.556 --> 00:00:28.303
Need ideas?

00:00:28.303 --> 00:00:34.006
Try Kiritimati, Aldabra, Nauru, St Kilda, South Georgia, Rapa Iti, Lord Howe Island,

00:00:34.006 --> 00:00:38.826
Jan Mayen, or one of the many islands of Indonesia and the Philippines,

00:00:38.826 --> 00:00:41.813
which island studies has largely overlooked.
